      "end": 296.26,
      "text": "B: 一小时"
    },
    {
      "start": 296.31,
      "end": 298.68,
      "text": "C: 四分钟"
    },
    {
      "start": 304.38,
      "end": 311.63,
      "text": "A！「Viertel vor zwölf」就是11:45。离小人偶出场还有15分钟。"
    },
    {
      "start": 311.88,
      "end": 313.21,
      "text": "跟我说！"
    },
    {
      "start": 313.26,
      "end": 315.39,
      "text": "现在几点？"
    },
    {
